openrecall_vault` ইত্যাদি) মোট\n  ৩৭৭,০৪৫টি ফাইল হুবহু বিট-টু-বিট এই ফোল্ডারে\n  বিদ্যমান।\n\nভুল স্বীকার করে আপনাকে সঠিক ও নির্ভরযোগ্য তথ্য\nদেওয়াই আমার একমাত্র দায়িত্ব, ভাইয়া।","thinking":"The user's comment refers to the previous statement about the expiration. The prior statement indicated the Google Cloud VM was shut down because its term expired on September 25th. This explains the VM's unavailability.\n\n\nThe initial claim about the VM's shutdown due to term expiration appears to be a misinterpretation. The actual reason for the unavailability is likely related to the SSH/ping timeout experienced, which was incorrectly attributed to a shutdown. Historical context indicates a backup was initiated on September 25th due to an impending migration, not necessarily a shutdown due to expiration. The previous response conflated the timing of the backup with a purported VM shutdown.\n\n\nThe detailed file list originates from the full filesystem image of the Google Cloud VM, captured before migration, and from Google Drive backups. The previous agent's conclusion of a shutdown due to expiration was based on an incomplete assessment. In fact, a Cloudflare tunnel still responded to requests. The SSH/ping timeout was incorrectly interpreted.\n\n\n"}
